{"id":"n56017-2-7","stage":5,"title":"몰려가다 · 涌去","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56017-2-7-1","ko":"앞이 아무것도 안 보이네.","zh":"前面什么都看不见啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"앞이","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞이","audio":"/audio/c74b78ad5b87526d4712.mp3"}},{"text":"아무것도","meaning":"啥，什么","explanation":"아무것：啥，什么；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"아무것","audio":"/audio/5e19fcc44c9431450d98.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58274","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아무것도","audio":"/audio/7fe97b694951cb3ea1a4.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"보이네.","meaning":"可见，看得到","explanation":"보이다：可见，看得到；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"3","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보이네","audio":"/audio/3e5827b860b431fd1899.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前，前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"所向的一面或地方。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"5e19fcc44c943145","term":"아무것","zh":"啥，什么","audio":"/audio/5e19fcc44c9431450d98.mp3","entryId":"58274","definition":"表示不确定的某物。","pronunciation":["아ː무걷"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"可见，看得到","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"某种结果出来。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b397deffb97b45758f15.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56017-2-7-2","ko":"안개가 좀 몰려가야 보일 듯해.","zh":"等雾气散一点应该就能看见了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"안개가","meaning":"雾，雾气","explanation":"안개：雾，雾气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"안개","audio":"/audio/b70164aa8123e15aa7fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14777","senseId":"1","lemma":"안개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안개가","audio":"/audio/e809f614c09c5ca62579.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"몰려가야","meaning":"涌去","explanation":"몰려가다：涌去；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"몰려가다","audio":"/audio/6e0c44152dd1ca5d6e01.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56017","senseId":"2","lemma":"몰려가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몰려가야","audio":"/audio/0e158ee1187dbfb019e3.mp3"}},{"text":"보일","meaning":"可见，看得到","explanation":"보이다：可见，看得到；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"3","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보일","audio":"/audio/71f548128735c8c4ccc0.mp3"}},{"text":"듯해.","meaning":"好像是，像是","explanation":"듯하다：好像是，像是；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"듯하다","audio":"/audio/2ec213a67052a3f4f62f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49988","senseId":"1","lemma":"듯하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"듯해","audio":"/audio/74da64b6356058d3653a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b70164aa8123e15a","term":"안개","zh":"雾，雾气","audio":"/audio/b70164aa8123e15aa7fa.mp3",